 function help(){modal('HOW TO PLAY','<p>Take the trophy and reach the EXIT without being seen. It is turn based: you take one step, then every camera, laser and drone takes one. Nothing moves while you think.</p><div class="helpgrid"><section><h3>MOVE</h3><div class="keys"><kbd>CLICK A CELL</kbd><span>walk there; stops before a step that would be seen</span><kbd>&larr; &rarr; / A D</kbd><span>walk along a floor</span><kbd>&uarr; &darr; / W S</kbd><span>climb, only at ladders</span><kbd>SPACE</kbd><span>wait one turn</span></div></section><section><h3>ACT</h3><div class="keys"><kbd>E</kbd><span>use a vent</span><kbd>L</kbd><span>flip the lights, next to a switch</span><kbd>Q</kbd><span>EMP: electronics off for 4 turns</span><kbd>Z</kbd><span>rewind a turn (makes it practice)</span><kbd>R</kbd><span>retry</span></div></section><section><h3>READ THE BUILDING</h3><p>Lime beams and dotted fields are danger now. Dashed boxes are danger next turn (FORECAST, F). INSPECT (I) reads any device and its timing without spending a turn.</p></section><section><h3>DEVICES</h3><p>Cards open doors A and B. Switches 1 and 2 flip circuits. Crates on plates hold grids G and H open. Door D needs circuit 1; the exit relay R also needs the trophy. A heavy trophy may not fit a vent.</p></section></div><p class="note">Shared Last Heist raids forbid EMP and rewinds, and their real clock keeps running while you pause.</p><div class="toolbar"><button class="primary" data-route="learn">LEARN BY PLAYING</button></div>');}
